## Settings Panel (preserved features)
- Language toggle (English / Arabic+English)
- Background theme selector (Emerald, Indigo, Crimson, Obsidian)
- Clock style selector (Analog, Digital, Both)
- Layout density selector (Standard, Compact)
- Todo list visibility toggle (Show/Hide) — hides only `.todo-card`, NOT the whole column
- Second clock timezone selector
- Third clock timezone selector
